  "historical_output_text": " Use an informal tone and include personal details about the hobby.\n\nHey [Friend's Name]! Hope you're doing well. I've been really into knitting lately. You know, those cozy scarves and hats that make you feel warm and snug? It's surprisingly relaxing, and I've been trying to make some unique patterns. Last weekend, I finished a cute little beanie for my cat, Whiskers. She loves it so much that she naps on it all the time now. I'm thinking of doing more cat-related accessories next. Maybe a blanket for the whole feline gang? Have you tried any new hobbies recently? I'd love to hear about it!\n\nTake care and talk soon,\n[Your Name] 🧶💕\n\n---\n\nFeel free to personalize this message further to better match your relationship with your friend! �",
